    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "All equipment names and measurements in this file are constructed teaching data.\n",
      "start": 19,
      "end": 100,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual",
      "block_id": "3373129cca492f3e"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "## Version 1 inspection\n",
      "start": 101,
      "end": 125,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 1 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 1 inspection",
      "block_id": "391482edfb080e79"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Only after power is disconnected, inspect the cooling fan. The temperature limit is 70 C.\n",
      "start": 126,
      "end": 216,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 1 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 1 inspection",
      "block_id": "a709a3c24e28a500"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "| Device | Limit | Unit |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| DEMO-A | 70 | C |\n| DEMO-B | 65 | C |\n",
      "start": 217,
      "end": 303,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 1 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 1 inspection",
      "block_id": "2e1f68678a6e8e98"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "code",
      "text": "```python\n# A fenced block must not be split into unrelated retrieval chunks.\nif power_disconnected:\n    inspect_fan()\n```\n",
      "start": 304,
      "end": 427,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 1 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 1 inspection",
      "block_id": "edbd092931d71770"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The table is not permission to touch a running fan; the preceding safety condition applies.\n",
      "start": 428,
      "end": 520,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 1 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 1 inspection",
      "block_id": "8f132895c105e4b8"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "## Version 2 inspection\n",
      "start": 521,
      "end": 545,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 2 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 2 inspection",
      "block_id": "38d59aa2530e9503"
    },
    {
      "source": "document",
      "version": "1",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Version 2 changes the DEMO-A limit to 68 C; do not mix version 1 and version 2 limits.\n",
      "start": 546,
      "end": 633,
      "heading": [
        "DEMO-FAN manual",
        "Version 2 inspection"
      ],
      "parent": "DEMO-FAN manual/Version 2 inspection",
